text: |-
  • Al Overview
  MD
  In August 2025, U.S. Marines and French Foreign
  Legionnaires from the 2nd Foreign Infantry
  Regiment (2e REI) trained together at the Marine
  Corps Air Ground Combat Center in California
  as part of the Service Level Training Exercise
  (SLTE) 4-25. The exercise, which ran from August
  4 to 25, focused on improving interoperability
  between the two allied forces through realistic
  scenarios like close-quarters combat and urban
  terrain training.
